  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業電子化",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTRONIC BUSINESS",
    "describe_ch": "隨著資訊通訊科技的進步，改變了企業的各項管理活動以及商業模式，對於企業來說，資訊通訊科技(Information and Communication Technology, ICT)的應用，及企業電子化(Electronic Business, EB) 已經是企業永續經營及維持競爭力的營運管理主軸及重要管理活動；本課程內容包括科技對於企業活動與商業經濟行為的影響、商業模式與獲利方式改變、以及資訊科技企業管理活動的應用等，包括企業資源規劃(ERP)、顧客關係管理(CRM)、供應鏈管理(SCM)、知識管理(KM)、商業智慧(BI)、電子商務(eCommerce)等整體的介紹，以及相關的技術與實務應用等內容。",
    "describe_eh": "E-business is a dynamic interdisciplinary topic utilizing concepts from business and technology. In this course, the basics of e-business are introduced from both aspects: the effect of e-business on traditional business and reasons that lead to the current use of e-business. Forms of e-business are studied in addition to various revenue models. Strategies that lead to a successful e-business such as enterprise resource planning (ERP), customer relation management (CRM), supply chain management (SCM), knowledge management (KM), and business intelligence (BI) are introduced. Needed software tools and concepts for setting up and maintaining an e-business are introduced. Security and legal issues are also covered.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "describe_ch": "具理解與評估企業電子化基本概念、應用範疇、與相關技術的能力",
      "describe_en": "Be able to understand the concept and primary functions of E-Business comprehensively, various models for business, and the related technology."
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "describe_ch": "探討企業電子化典範，以瞭解相關應用範疇與商業模式",
      "describe_en": "Survey the best practices of E-Business to understand the related applications and business models in current business"
    }
  ],
